{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c465ae8e-e27f-8387-9cd8-ce34cbc6b4d3",
  "created_at": "2026-01-13T11:35:43-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Yusuf Cohen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:31:42-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:31:46-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, good morning. I'm calling about a storm drain that's backed up. Water's all over the street here, I'm at 8 Rhode Island Avenue, up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:31:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "8 Rhode Island Avenue. Okay. And you said the drain is backed up, so is the water coming up out of it or just not going down?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:32:07-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not going down. It's sitting there. It's over the curb and across the whole sidewalk. Sorry, the headset keeps rubbing my chin, you might hear that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:32:17-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, I can hear you. Over the curb and across the sidewalk. Is this from the storm over the weekend?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:32:25-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, the coastal storm Friday and Saturday. That was three days ago and it never really drained. We had a little rain this morning and it's worse again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:32:36-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is it a safety problem right now, like is anyone not able to get through?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:32:43-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, a delivery truck got stuck in it about an hour ago. Box truck. He tried to pull up to the curb and bogged down. He got out eventually, but it's a mess."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:32:56-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A delivery truck got stuck in the water, and he's since gotten out. Got it. Is the water getting into anyone's property?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:33:05-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's moving toward my neighbor's garage. It's running down the grade that way. Not in yet, but it's maybe ten, fifteen feet off the door."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:33:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ten or fifteen feet from the neighbor's garage. Okay, I'm writing that down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:33:21-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can I ask something? Is that a city drain or a state one? I never know on these streets. Somebody told me once some of them belong to the state."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:33:32-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. Most of the drains on a residential street like that are ours, so I'd log it with us. If the crew gets there and finds it's a state one, they'll pass it along themselves. You don't have to chase that part."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:33:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that works for me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:33:51-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me make sure I have this right. 8 Rhode Island Avenue, Historic Hill. Storm drain not draining since the weekend storm, water over the curb and across the sidewalk, a truck got stuck, and it's heading toward a neighbor's garage. Is the drain right in front of your building?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:34:10-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right in front, yeah. Basically at the curb by the front steps. There might be leaves packed on top of it, but I can't see the grate with all the water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:34:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, leaves on the grate possibly. Is it in front of 8 or a little to one side?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:34:29-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Little toward the neighbor's side. The low spot is there, that's why it runs down to the garage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:34:36-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Low spot on the neighbor's side of the property. I'll mark this as urgent given the garage and the vehicle problem. Can I get a number in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:34:50-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0153."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:34:52-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0153. And it's Mr. Cohen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:34:55-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yusuf Cohen, yeah. C-O-H-E-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:34:57-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Cohen. I'm sending this to the drainage crew now. With the storm cleanup they're stretched, but an urgent flag with water heading to a garage should put it near the top for today or tomorrow morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:35:12-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. If it gets into the garage before then, should I call back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:35:18-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, call right back and tell whoever answers that it's an update on the Rhode Island Avenue drain. We'll add it to the same report. And if the water ever becomes a danger to anyone, call the emergency line."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:35:33-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:35:35-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Thanks for calling in, and stay out of that puddle."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:35:40-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, yeah. Thanks. Bye now."
    }
  ],
